CON

{{
 This is a stray {{ }} doc block in the middle of the file -- WRONG, {{ }}
 is footer-only per the guide's normative body (Part 4.1).
}}

  MAX_COUNT = 10

PUB doThing(paramOne) : status
'' Do a thing.
''

    status := paramOne

